       "The fear of the LORD runs through all of these books, so it needs explaining now. It is not terror that drives a person away from God. It is the awe that draws a person near, takes God seriously and wants what He wants. In the Berean, “LORD” in capitals stands for God’s personal name, revealed to Moses; “Lord” in ordinary type, as in ",
